      "refersTo": "home-hero-primary",
      "description": "Variante local DM Sans del hero de portada; conserva foco, hover y pulsación.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-button\" href=\"/#visita\">Prepara tu visita<svg class=\"ds-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-button{min-height:50px;padding:.8rem 1.4rem;display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:1rem;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-weight:500;font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.55;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid transparent;transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms,transform 150ms;}.ds-button:active{transform:translateY(1px);}.ds-icon{width:1.25em;height:1.25em;flex:none;transition:transform 150ms var(--ease-out);}@media(hover:hover){.ds-button:hover .ds-icon{transform:translate(2px,-2px);}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button,.ds-icon{transition:none;}.ds-button:active,.ds-button:hover .ds-icon{transform:none;}}:focus-visible{outline:3px solid currentColor;outline-offset:5px;}.ds-button{font:500 1rem var(--font-sans);min-height:54px;padding:.8rem 1.5rem;border-radius:999px;}@media(max-width:599px){.ds-button{font-size:.95rem;min-height:48px;width:min(100%,260px);padding:.65rem 1rem;}}.ds-button{background:var(--color-sun);color:var(--color-forest);}@media(hover:hover){.ds-button:hover{background:#ffdd50;}}"
