    {
      "name": "Botón de línea solar",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-line",
      "description": "Variante implementada; conserva foco, hover, pulsación y movimiento reducido.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-stage\"><a class=\"ds-button\" href=\"/participa/\">Comparte tu idea<svg class=\"ds-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-button{min-height:50px;padding:.8rem 1.4rem;display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:1rem;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-weight:500;font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.55;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid transparent;transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms,transform 150ms;}.ds-button:active{transform:translateY(1px);}.ds-icon{width:1.25em;height:1.25em;flex:none;transition:transform 150ms var(--ease-out);}@media(hover:hover){.ds-button:hover .ds-icon{transform:translate(2px,-2px);}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button,.ds-icon{transition:none;}.ds-button:active,.ds-button:hover .ds-icon{transform:none;}}:focus-visible{outline:3px solid currentColor;outline-offset:5px;}.ds-stage{background:var(--color-forest);padding:1rem;}.ds-button{border-color:var(--color-sun);background:transparent;color:var(--color-sun);}@media(hover:hover){.ds-button:hover{background:var(--color-sun);color:var(--color-forest);}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Búsqueda del directorio",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "directory-input",
      "description": "Campo de búsqueda visible al disponer de JavaScript; el ejemplo muestra su presentación.",
      "html": "<form class=\"ds-search\" role=\"search\" action=\"/empresas/\"><label for=\"ds-business-query\">Buscar en el directorio</label><div><svg class=\"ds-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 16 5 5M18 10a8 8 0 1 1-16 0 8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"/></svg><input id=\"ds-business-query\" name=\"q\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Nombre o actividad…\" autocomplete=\"off\"/><button type=\"submit\">Buscar</button></div></form>",
      "css": ".ds-search{font-family:var(--font-sans);color:var(--color-forest);line-height:1.55;}.ds-search label{font-size:.75rem;display:block;margin-bottom:.4rem;}.ds-search>div{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.75rem;padding-left:.8rem;border:1px solid var(--color-forest);}.ds-icon{width:1.25em;height:1.25em;flex:none;}.ds-search input{font-family:var(--font-sans);min-height:48px;padding:.5rem 0;background:transparent;width:230px;min-width:0;font-size:16px;caret-color:var(--color-forest);border:0;}.ds-search input::placeholder{color:var(--color-muted);}.ds-search button{font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:1rem;background:var(--color-forest);color:var(--color-ivory);border:0;min-height:48px;padding:.5rem 1rem;flex-shrink:0;white-space:nowrap;}@media(max-width:599px){.ds-search input{width:100%;}.ds-search>div{gap:.5rem;}.ds-search button{padding-inline:.75rem;}}:focus-visible{outline:3px solid currentColor;outline-offset:5px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Navegación principal",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation",
      "description": "Muestra de destinos y estados de escritorio compartidos; Header.astro mantiene panel móvil, grupos y gestión de foco. La marca de cabecera usa el escudo municipal de https://aytonavaluenga.es/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/escudo.png, conservado en src/assets/escudo-navaluenga.png y documentado en ASSETS.md, junto a Ayuntamiento de y Navaluenga; este ejemplo muestra solo los destinos.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Navegación principal\"><a href=\"/#descubrir\">Descubrir</a><a href=\"/#vivir\">Vivir aquí</a><a href=\"/tramites/\">Trámites y servicios</a><a href=\"/contacto/\">Ayuntamiento</a><a href=\"/empresas/\">Empresas</a><a class=\"ds-sede\" href=\"https://navaluenga.sedelectronica.es/\">Sede electrónica<svg class=\"ds-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14\"/></svg></a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:clamp(.5rem,1.1vw,1.3rem);padding:0 var(--gutter);min-height:88px;background:var(--color-forest);color:var(--color-ivory);font-family:var(--font-sans);line-height:1.55;}.ds-nav a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;min-height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;font-size:.85rem;font-weight:400;transition:color 160ms;}.ds-nav a:hover,.ds-nav a[aria-current=page]{color:var(--color-sun);}.ds-nav .ds-sede{background:var(--color-ivory);color:var(--color-forest);border-radius:999px;padding:.55rem 1rem;font-size:.8rem;transition:background-color 160ms;}.ds-nav .ds-sede:hover{background:var(--color-sun);}.ds-icon{width:1.25em;height:1.25em;flex:none;}.ds-nav a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid currentColor;outline-offset:5px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav a{transition:none;}}"
    },
    {
